              <PxRuler length={22} color="rgba(43,127,212,0.16)" />
            </div>

            <p style={{ fontSize:16, color:C.muted, lineHeight:1.85, maxWidth:430,
              fontFamily:SANS, marginBottom:48, ...xStyle(2,180) }}>
              NexYuva uses AI to match students with top internships under the
